[[feedback:prt5]]

[[feedback:prt6]]




&lt;p&gt;
Identify the point where the two
relations intersect.

Enter the ordered pair as
\[
[x,y].
\]
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
[[input:ans9]]
[[validation:ans9]]
[[feedback:prt7]]
&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;
Finally, state the solution of the
simultaneous equations as the ordered
pair \([x,y]\).
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
[[input:ans10]]
[[validation:ans10]]
[[feedback:prt8]]
&lt;/p&gt;

      </text>
